WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
Welcome to College by Design. I’m Brian Kennedy

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:07.760
Jr. Your goal is an education-and-enterprise portfolio. Name

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.560
an education decision and two realistic routes you

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.680
can investigate. Keep your work private, record what

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.720
you tried, and set a review date. Self-guided

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.440
toolkit; no admissions, internship, employment, income or wealth

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.080
guarantee.
